    "message": "Evaluate model variants on the shared generated Scenario\n\nEight tests built their own Scenario with InitialScenarioBuilder (8\nevacuees, one day, seed 7) as the base for parameter catalogue and\nvariant checks. They now use the shared generated_scenario fixture, or\ngenerated_scenario_with for entered stock and a staff shift (#88).\n\nThe file is formatted with ruff, which also wraps two long lines it\nalready had.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
